<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1384492893"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1468053511"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Hold On"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ILLENIUM / Georgia Ku"/><amll:meta key="album" value="ASCEND"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:42.581"><div begin="00:00.748" end="03:42.581"><p begin="00:00.748" end="00:04.858" itunes:key="L217107">I can't listen to these stupid songs<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不能再听这些愚蠢的歌</span></p><p begin="00:07.465" end="00:10.924" itunes:key="L217108">'Cause they all remind me that you're gone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为它们会让我想起你已离我而去</span></p><p begin="00:13.615" end="00:17.205" itunes:key="L217109">I'm still sleeping in your favorite tee<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我还是穿着你最爱的T恤睡觉</span></p><p begin="00:17.309" end="00:20.236" itunes:key="L217110">Pictures I just can't delete<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">照片我都不愿删除</span></p><p begin="00:20.726" end="00:24.659" itunes:key="L217111">Don't know how to be, how to be alone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知道一个人该怎么办</span></p><p begin="00:25.890" end="00:31.358" itunes:key="L217112">If I can't live without you, I can't live at all<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有你 我就不能活 完全不想活</span></p><p begin="00:32.129" end="00:39.497" itunes:key="L217113">I'm sick of finding reasons to feel the way I did before<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不愿再想尽办法装作一切和从前一样</span></p><p begin="00:40.228" end="00:43.066" itunes:key="L217114">I don't wanna waste another day<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不想再浪费时间</span></p><p begin="00:43.418" end="00:46.257" itunes:key="L217115">I don't wanna wish that you would stay<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不想对你心存幻想 妄想你能留下</span></p><p begin="00:46.267" end="00:48.958" itunes:key="L217116">If I know I should let go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果我知道我应该放手</span></p><p begin="00:49.571" end="00:52.215" itunes:key="L217117">Why do I hold on to you?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何我还放不下你</span></p><p begin="00:52.529" end="00:55.628" itunes:key="L217118">I don't wanna waste another day<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不想再浪费时间</span></p><p begin="00:56.006" end="00:58.746" itunes:key="L217119">I don't wanna say I'm not okay<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不想说我不好</span></p><p begin="00:58.788" end="01:01.486" itunes:key="L217120">If I know I should let go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果我知道我应该放手</span></p><p begin="01:02.136" end="01:04.789" itunes:key="L217121">Why do I hold on to you?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何我还放不下你</span></p><p begin="01:14.823" end="01:17.363" itunes:key="L217122">Why do I hold on to you?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何我还放不下你</span></p><p begin="01:27.457" end="01:29.915" itunes:key="L217123">Why do I hold on to you?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何我还放不下你</span></p><p begin="01:35.907" end="01:39.351" itunes:key="L217124">I'm still listening to this stupid song<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我还是在听这首愚蠢的歌</span></p><p begin="01:41.969" end="01:48.000" itunes:key="L217125">Like I don't know where it all went wrong, mmm<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好像我不知道到底哪里出错了</span></p><p begin="01:48.521" end="01:51.791" itunes:key="L217126">All my friends are asking where you been<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的朋友都在问你去了哪里</span></p><p begin="01:52.041" end="01:54.827" itunes:key="L217127">Memories keep on creeping in<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">回忆不断侵袭而来</span></p><p begin="01:55.416" end="02:01.654" itunes:key="L217128">Don't know how to be, how to be alone, hey<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知道一个人该怎么办</span></p><p begin="02:02.294" end="02:05.116" itunes:key="L217129">I don't wanna waste another day<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不想再浪费时间</span></p><p begin="02:05.505" end="02:08.366" itunes:key="L217130">I don't wanna wish that you would stay<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不想对你心存幻想 妄想你能留下</span></p><p begin="02:08.368" end="02:10.955" itunes:key="L217131">If I know I should let go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果我知道我应该放手</span></p><p begin="02:11.704" end="02:14.206" itunes:key="L217132">Why do I hold on to you?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何我还放不下你</span></p><p begin="02:14.891" end="02:17.724" itunes:key="L217133">I don't wanna waste another day<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不想再浪费时间</span></p><p begin="02:18.136" end="02:20.894" itunes:key="L217134">I don't wanna say I'm not okay<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不想说我不好</span></p><p begin="02:21.024" end="02:23.645" itunes:key="L217135">If I know I should let go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果我知道我应该放手</span></p><p begin="02:24.377" end="02:26.774" itunes:key="L217136">Why do I hold on to you?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何我还放不下你</span></p><p begin="02:32.013" end="02:32.994" itunes:key="L217137">Hold on to you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">放不下你</span></p><p begin="02:37.048" end="02:39.399" itunes:key="L217138">Why do I hold on to you?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何我还放不下你</span></p><p begin="02:49.577" end="02:52.021" itunes:key="L217139">Why do I hold on to you?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何我还放不下你</span></p><p begin="02:52.058" end="02:54.924" itunes:key="L217140">Why, oh why do I lose my mind<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为什么我会失去理智</span></p><p begin="02:54.934" end="02:56.421" itunes:key="L217141">When I hold on tight?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我明明那么坚定</span></p><p begin="02:56.431" end="02:58.368" itunes:key="L217142">No, I don't wanna let go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不想放手</span></p><p begin="02:58.481" end="03:01.055" itunes:key="L217143">Why, oh why do I lose my mind<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为什么我会失去理智</span></p><p begin="03:01.224" end="03:02.524" itunes:key="L217144">When I hold on tight?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我明明那么坚定</span></p><p begin="03:02.704" end="03:04.556" itunes:key="L217145">No, I don't wanna let go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不想放手</span></p><p begin="03:04.718" end="03:07.336" itunes:key="L217146">Why, oh why do I lose my mind<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为什么我会失去理智</span></p><p begin="03:07.505" end="03:08.875" itunes:key="L217147">When I hold on tight?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我明明那么坚定</span></p><p begin="03:09.066" end="03:10.817" itunes:key="L217148">No, I don't wanna let go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不想放手</span></p><p begin="03:10.950" end="03:15.469" itunes:key="L217149">(Don't wanna let go, don't wanna let go, don't wanna let go)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不想放手</span></p><p begin="03:15.484" end="03:17.921" itunes:key="L217150">I don't wanna let go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不想放手</span></p><p begin="03:18.100" end="03:20.894" itunes:key="L217151">I don't wanna waste another day<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不想再浪费时间</span></p><p begin="03:21.230" end="03:24.063" itunes:key="L217152">I don't wanna wish that you would stay<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不想对你心存幻想 妄想你能留下</span></p><p begin="03:24.200" end="03:26.751" itunes:key="L217153">If I know I should let go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果我知道我应该放手</span></p><p begin="03:27.500" end="03:29.932" itunes:key="L217154">Why do I hold on to you?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何我还放不下你</span></p><p begin="03:30.710" end="03:33.479" itunes:key="L217155">I don't wanna waste another day<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不想再浪费时间</span></p><p begin="03:33.850" end="03:36.544" itunes:key="L217156">I don't wanna say I'm not okay<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不想说我不好</span></p><p begin="03:36.821" end="03:39.272" itunes:key="L217157">If I know I should let go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果我知道我应该放手</span></p><p begin="03:40.073" end="03:42.581" itunes:key="L217158">Why do I hold on to you?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何我还放不下你</span></p></div></body></tt>